  pages:
  - title: Assault Command
    topText: Please click on the deployed unit. The green area represents its movement
      range this turn.
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bac83c5e46b15d046951caffa24bd177, type: 3}
    bottomText: Click a green square to move the selected unit there.
  - title: Assault Command
    topText: When a unit's movement points are exhausted, or when you click on the
      tile occupied by the unit, you may select the action the unit will perform
      this turn.
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d65f36b0920f8f942a5eba76893321ee, type: 3}
    bottomText: Please try selecting an attack and attacking an enemy within range.
